sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as MEDITECH
  participant LB as Internal Azure Load Balancer
  participant P1 as gateway pod 1
  participant P2 as gateway pod 2
  participant JS as NATS JetStream
  participant A as Lab API
  M->>LB: ORU^R01 (MLLP :7890, over ExpressRoute or VPN)
  LB->>P1: forward
  P1->>JS: publish (3 replicas)
  JS-->>P1: stored
  P1-->>M: ACK AA
  P2->>JS: fetch next message
  JS-->>P2: the message
  P2->>A: POST (HTTPS)
  A-->>P2: 200
  P2->>JS: ack
  Note over P1: pod 1 deleted (node drained or zone lost)
  LB->>LB: health check fails, pod 1 removed
  M->>LB: next message
  LB->>P2: forward
  P2->>JS: publish
  P2-->>M: ACK AA
  Note over P1: Kubernetes starts a replacement pod
